# Blog app environment variables
#
# Do NOT add real credentials here — this file is committed to git.
#
# Copy to apps/blog/.env.local and fill in your values for local development.
# In production, set these variables through your hosting platform (e.g. Vercel).

# No environment variables are required yet — this app is scaffolding-only
# (Task Master task 17). Content is read from ../../content/posts/ on disk,
# no database or external service involved.
#
# apps/site reads BLOG_APP_URL to rewrite /blog/* to this app's deployment
# (Vercel multi-zone) — that variable lives in apps/site/.env.example, not
# here, since it's consumed by apps/site.
